<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Capral half yr net profit edges down.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Capral half yr net profit edges down.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    28.29 vs 34.84</p>
<p>    Net				     17.80 vs 17.93</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	   8.00 vs 8.00</p>
